","parts":[{"text":"பாகல்","lemma":"பாகல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கரும்பு","parts":[{"text":"கரும்பு","lemma":"karumpu","gloss":"sugarcane"}],"gloss":"sugarcane"},{"surface":"அல்லது","parts":[{"text":"அல்லது","lemma":"allatu","gloss":"other than"}],"gloss":"other than"},{"surface":"காடு","parts":[{"text":"காடு","lemma":"kāṭu","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"forest"},{"surface":"அறியா","parts":[{"text":"அறியா","lemma":"aṟi","gloss":"not knowing"}],"gloss":"not knowing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருந்","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்","lemma":"பெருந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தண்பணை","parts":[{"text":"தண்பணை","lemma":"தண்பணை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பாழ்","parts":[{"text":"பாழ்","lemma":"பாழ்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆக","parts":[{"text":"ஆக","lemma":"ஆக","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"ஏமம்","parts":[{"text":"ஏமம்","lemma":"ēmam","gloss":"protection"}],"gloss":"protection"},{"surface":"நல்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"நாடு","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"nāṭu","gloss":"country"}],"gloss":"country"},{"surface":"ஒள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒள்","lemma":"oḷ","gloss":"bright"}],"gloss":"bright"},{"surface":"எரி","parts":[{"text":"எரி","lemma":"eri","gloss":"fire"}],"gloss":"fire"},{"surface":"ஊட்டினை","parts":[{"text":"ஊட்டினை","lemma":"ūṭṭu","gloss":"you fed"}],"gloss":"you fed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாம","parts":[{"text":"நாம","lemma":"nāmam","gloss":"fear/dread"}],"gloss":"fear/dread"},{"surface":"நல்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good/intense"}],"gloss":"good/intense"},{"surface":"அமர்","parts":[{"text":"அமர்","lemma":"amar","gloss":"battle"}],"gloss":"battle"},{"surface":"செய்ய","parts":[{"text":"செய்ய","lemma":"ceyya","gloss":"to do"}],"gloss":"to do"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒராங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஒராங்கு","lemma":"orāṅku","gloss":"together / in one accord"}],"gloss":"together / in one accord"},{"surface":"மலைந்தன","parts":[{"text":"மலைந்தன","lemma":"malai","gloss":"fought / clashed"}],"gloss":"fought / clashed"},{"surface":"பெரும","parts":[{"text":"பெரும","lemma":"perumaṉ","gloss":"O great one"}],"gloss":"O great one"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"niṉ","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"களிறே","parts":[{"text":"களிறே","lemma":"kaḷiṟu","gloss":"male elephants indeed"}],"gloss":"male elephants indeed"}]}],"literal":"With swift horses of excellent action, / spreading shields resembling clouds, / going to the front to destroy the enemy, / feeding them with mature fields seized, / making house-trees into firewood, / causing male elephants to bathe in guarded waterfront waters, / the bright light of burning fire set to appear in daylight / appearing like the red twilight of the setting sun, / with a boundless army encamping to ruin the land, / with victory in battle needing no allies, / with drying sandal paste on the flesh-smelling sword, / O dread-inspiring lord of Murugan's wrath! / Where intertwined vallai, blossoming water lily, / dewy pakanrai, unripe bitter gourd, / and sugarcane are the only forest known, / making that great cool agricultural tract a ruin, / you fed bright fire to the protected good country, / to wage a dreadful great battle, / together fought, O great one, your male elephants!","translation":"O great lord of dread-inspiring wrath like Murugan, who wins victories in battle without needing allies, your sword smelling of flesh and smeared with drying sandal paste! With swift, well-trained horses and cloud-like shields spread wide, your boundless army marched to the front, destroying the enemy. They fed on the seized mature crop fields, used the trees of homesteads as firewood, and bathed your war elephants in the guarded waters of the bathing ghats. The bright, burning fires they set blazed in the daylight, looking like the red twilight of the setting sun, ruining the land. That great, cool, fertile agricultural tract—where the only 'forest' known was the dense growth of intertwined vallai creepers, blossoming water lilies, dewy pakanrai, bitter gourds, and sugarcane—has now been laid to waste. You have fed bright fire to that protected, beautiful country. To wage this dreadful battle, O great king, your war elephants fought together in one accord!","modern":"சிறந்த உழைப்பைக் கொண்ட வேகமான குதிரைகளுடனும், மேகம் போன்ற கேடயங்களை ஏந்தியும், பகைவரின் போர்க்களத்தை அழிக்கச் சென்று, அவர்களின் விளைந்த வயல்களைக் கவர்ந்து குதிரைகளுக்கு ஊட்டி, வீடுகளின் மரங்களை விறகுகளாக்கி, காவல் மிகுந்த நீர்நிலைகளில் உமது ஆண் யானைகளைக் குளிப்பாட்டினாய். பகல் பொழுதிலும் நீ மூட்டிய சுடுநெருப்பின் வெளிச்சம், மறையும் சூரியனின் செவ்வானம் போலத் தோன்றியது. எல்லையற்ற உமது படை பகைநாட்டை அழிக்கத் தங்கியது. துணையின்றி வெல்லும் போர்த்திறனும், புலால் நாற்றமடிக்கும் வாளில் காய்ந்த சந்தனமும் உடையவனே, முருகன் போன்ற சினமும் அச்சம் தரும் பெருமையும் உடைய தலைவனே! பின்னிப் பிணைந்த வள்ளைக் கொடி, மலர்ந்த ஆம்பல், பனி பொருந்திய பகன்றை, கசப்பான பாகல், கரும்பு ஆகியவற்றைத் தவிர வேறு காடுகளையே அறியாத அந்தப் பெரிய குளிர்ந்த வயல்வெளிகள் பாழாகும்படி, காவல் மிகுந்த அந்த நல்ல நாட்டிற்கு நீ தீயிட்டாய். அச்சம் தரும் போரைச் செய்ய, பெருமானே, உமது ஆண் யானைகள் அனைத்தும் ஒன்றுசேர்ந்து போரிட்டன!","explanation":"The poet Pāṇṭaraṅ Kaṇṇhaṉār is praising the Chola king Cōḻaṉ Irācacūyam Vēṭṭa Perunaṟkiḷḷi. The poem is set in the vañci tiṇai (invasion/warfare) and maḻapula vañci tuṟai (destroying the enemy's fertile lands). The poet describes the utter devastation brought upon the enemy's fertile country by the king's invading army. The poet contrasts the former lushness of the enemy's land—where the only 'forests' were dense patches of sugarcane, water lilies, and creepers—with the current state of ruin, where homestead trees are used as firewood and the fields are set ablaze. The fire set by the invading army is so massive that it turns the daylight sky into a red twilight. Key words include vañci (invasion), kaḷiṟu (war elephant), cuṭutī (burning fire), and pāḻ (ruin/waste).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.7],[1.99,2.13],[2.13,2.71],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.5],[3.5,3.55],[3.55,3.6],[3.6,5.1],[5.1,5.2],[5.2,6.1],[6.1,6.2],[6.2,6.4],[6.4,7.1],[7.1,7.8],[7.8,8.1],[8.1,8.1],[8.1,8.5],[8.5,8.5],[8.5,8.5],[8.5,8.5],[8.5,8.77],[8.77,9.83],[9.83,10.86],[10.86,11.62],[12.0,12.4],[12.4,13.4],[13.4,13.6],[13.6,14.4],[14.4,14.8],[15.4,16.1],[16.1,16.5],[16.5,16.6],[16.6,17.4],[17.4,17.7],[17.7,18.43],[18.43,18.57],[18.7,19.0],[19.0,19.8],[19.8,20.1],[20.1,20.5],[20.5,20.6],[20.6,21.9],[21.9,22.1],[22.1,22.7],[22.7,22.8],[22.8,24.3],[24.3,24.4],[24.4,24.8],[24.8,24.9],[24.9,24.9],[24.9,24.9],[24.9,24.9],[24.9,24.9],[24.9,27.9],[27.9,28.0],[28.0,28.3],[28.3,28.7],[28.7,29.37],[29.37,29.88],[30.15,30.34],[30.61,30.7],[31.48,32.08],[32.2,32.58],[32.58,33.08],[33.08,33.35],[33.48,34.18],[34.18,34.68],[34.68,34.78],[34.78,36.18],[36.18,36.78],[36.78,37.08],[37.08,37.18],[37.18,37.68]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.3],[1.3,2.0],[2.0,2.67],[2.67,2.67],[2.67,2.67],[2.67,3.78],[3.78,4.0],[4.0,4.0],[4.0,6.2],[6.2,6.4],[6.4,7.3],[7.3,7.5],[7.5,7.7],[7.7,8.5],[8.5,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,9.9],[9.9,10.3],[10.3,10.67],[10.67,10.67],[10.67,11.4],[11.4,13.3],[13.3,13.3],[13.3,13.3],[13.3,14.1],[14.1,14.5],[14.5,16.1],[16.1,16.3],[16.3,17.4],[17.4,17.7],[18.48,19.28],[19.28,19.78],[19.78,19.88],[19.88,20.38],[20.38,20.9],[20.9,21.68],[21.68,22.08],[22.08,22.48],[22.48,23.48],[23.48,23.78],[23.78,24.08],[24.08,24.28],[24.28,25.48],[25.48,25.68],[25.68,26.28],[26.28,26.38],[26.38,27.88],[27.88,28.08],[28.08,28.48],[28.48,28.68],[28.68,28.91],[28.91,30.08],[30.08,30.48],[30.48,30.88],[30.88,31.88],[31.88,31.98],[31.98,32.28],[32.28,32.78],[32.78,33.38],[33.38,34.13],[34.13,34.73],[34.73,34.88],[35.64,36.24],[36.36,36.74],[36.74,36.95],[37.3,37.64],[37.64,38.5